{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26220760\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究M1经颅直流电刺激对帕金森猴运动症状的影响，不涉及STN神经活动或冻结步态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26222442\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究EP（GPi同源结构）DBS的神经保护作用，未研究STN与FOG的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26227561\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述纹状体胆碱能中间神经元及基底节微环路，可能为STN相关运动机制提供间接的环路背景，但摘要缺失。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26228625\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较PD伴与不伴FOG患者的胆碱能神经生理功能，可作为FOG非STN机制的交叉证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26236107\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述帕金森病平衡训练及心理获益，不涉及STN神经活动或FOG机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26236229\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PPTg区域DBS的个体化计算模型及邻近纤维通路，可能为比较STN与脑干步行网络的作用提供间接证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26241766\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD患者FOG相关的运动节律障碍，可为解释FOG的时间控制机制提供行为学证据，但没有STN神经记录。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26257895\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述PD的DBS治疗，涉及STN、PPN及FOG治疗，但对STN神经活动与FOG的具体关系并非重点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26259206\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究FOG发作前的自主神经生理变化，可能提供不同于STN神经振荡的FOG预测机制，但没有中枢神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26259857\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"题目直接涉及低频STN-DBS对FOG的改善作用，但文献类型为评论且无摘要，需要核实是否包含原始数据或重要机制讨论。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26305999\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD伴FOG患者的认知损害及脑灰质改变，可为额叶、颞叶和小脑参与FOG的竞争性机制提供影像学证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26319759\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统性神经生理综述直接比较STN、GPi、SNr及PPN相关DBS对步态和平衡的影响，涉及STN-DBS可能加重FOG及其神经生理机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26325394\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究帕金森病行走偏斜及视觉与运动不对称的作用，不涉及FOG或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26330809\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述PD的DBS靶点选择、刺激参数和副作用，可能提供STN-DBS轴性症状及步态不良反应的背景证据，但FOG神经机制不是重点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26332765\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究帕金森病患者步行速度的加速度计评估阈值，与STN神经活动及FOG机制无直接关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26335644\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究纹状体至SNr的GABA能突触前抑制及运动敏化，不涉及STN或FOG。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26339553\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究MPTP小鼠步态变化及运动学评估方法，没有涉及FOG特异性表现或STN神经活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26341909\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"利用PET研究实际行走及冻结期间的脑代谢变化，发现基底节输出和中脑运动区异常，可作为FOG中枢网络机制的直接影像学交叉证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26347052\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"属于节律性提示平衡训练的随机对照试验方案，不研究STN神经活动与FOG的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26351615\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD姿势畸形与额叶执行功能的关系，并非FOG或STN相关研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26354102\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究FOG患者的运动反应抑制障碍，为执行控制和基底节抑制功能异常导致FOG提供了竞争性机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26359798\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD-FOG患者的脑结构及功能连接异常，涉及脑干步行通路和认知运动网络，可用于构建STN以外的网络机制解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26363646\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"荟萃分析跑步机训练对PD步态的康复效果，没有涉及STN神经活动或FOG特异性机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26365958\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"提供STN-DBS长期临床疗效数据，但摘要未报告FOG特异性结局或神经活动记录，可能作为STN-DBS临床背景证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26381808\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"提出FOG与执行功能、反应抑制及注意力障碍相关的重要理论框架，可作为STN局部神经振荡机制之外的竞争性机制解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26388741\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述PPN神经振荡及其与DBS疗效的关系，可为比较脑干与基底节神经活动在PD轴性症状和FOG中的作用提供交叉证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26393595\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者上肢螺旋绘图及运动症状的客观量化，与STN神经活动和FOG无直接关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26394842\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD模型中PPN胆碱能神经元激活对运动障碍的影响，可为脑干胆碱能通路参与步态障碍提供间接机制证据，但未特异研究FOG或STN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26395829\",\n      \"decision\": \"maybe\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究PD冻结步态的生物力学和肌电变化，可辅助理解FOG的运动表型及外部提示效应，但没有STN神经活动数据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26400791\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究大鼠周围坐骨神经再生及神经电极记录，与帕金森病、STN及FOG均无直接关系。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5d754fa6-a34f-40b0-b012-27ea5a1fbc28", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T141659385124Z", "elapsed_seconds": 133.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T14:19:12.430542+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c8b1e32257bbbec1b6fcd462100f516a39e57cf6eb239eb428ea8e9500ba3a91", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T141659385124Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "17a48f1d0d7502eb006d7fec292369139a4483d52983b96042be172654556777"}}}
